From 0d5c11b904e2204650bf1b37814f573ef66dd5ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stanley Chu <yschu@nuvoton.com>
Date: Tue, 26 May 2026 13:49:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] mctp: Add USB hot-plug support with static EID assignment

Support MCTP USB devices inserted after boot by monitoring mctpd
interface events and re-triggering device configuration when a new
USB interface appears.

Allow MCTPUSBDevice entries in entity-manager to specify a fixed peer
EID via an optional "EID" property, which causes mctpreactor to use
AssignEndpointStatic instead of dynamic assignment.

Skip redundant re-assignment for already-configured devices when an
unrelated USB event triggers a configuration refresh.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [oe-specific]
Signed-off-by: Stanley Chu <yschu@nuvoton.com>
---
